<figure class="upstream-flow" aria-labelledby="upstream-flow-caption">
  <div class="upstream-flow__grid">
    <article class="upstream-flow__node upstream-flow__node--source">
      <span class="upstream-flow__label">Outside source</span>
      <strong>Upstream repository</strong>
      <code>repo · path · pinned commit</code>
      <span class="upstream-flow__detail">
        The source and license are named.
      </span>
    </article>
    <svg
      class="upstream-flow__wire"
      viewBox="0 0 100 30"
      aria-hidden="true"
      focusable="false"
    >
      <path class="upstream-flow__line" d="M3 15 H92 M84 6 L94 15 L84 24" />
      <path class="upstream-flow__spark" d="M3 15 H92" />
    </svg>
    <article class="upstream-flow__node upstream-flow__node--toolkit">
      <span class="upstream-flow__label">A proposed mirror</span>
      <strong>Toolkit update</strong>
      <code>literal files · license · checksums</code>
      <span class="upstream-flow__detail">
        Automation opens a draft; changed content stays experimental.
      </span>
    </article>
    <svg
      class="upstream-flow__wire upstream-flow__wire--middle"
      viewBox="0 0 100 30"
      aria-hidden="true"
      focusable="false"
    >
      <path class="upstream-flow__line" d="M3 15 H92 M84 6 L94 15 L84 24" />
      <path class="upstream-flow__spark" d="M3 15 H92" />
    </svg>
    <article class="upstream-flow__node upstream-flow__node--review">
      <span class="upstream-flow__label">Human trust review</span>
      <strong>Review & bind trust</strong>
      <code>diff · security · provenance digest</code>
      <span class="upstream-flow__detail">
        Only a named reviewer can restore reviewed status; otherwise it stays
        experimental.
      </span>
    </article>
    <svg
      class="upstream-flow__wire upstream-flow__wire--downstream"
      viewBox="0 0 100 30"
      aria-hidden="true"
      focusable="false"
    >
      <path class="upstream-flow__line" d="M3 15 H92 M84 6 L94 15 L84 24" />
      <path class="upstream-flow__spark" d="M3 15 H92" />
    </svg>
    <article class="upstream-flow__node upstream-flow__node--users">
      <span class="upstream-flow__label">Toolkit outputs</span>
      <strong>Declared targets</strong>
      <div class="upstream-flow__targets">
        <span>Claude Code</span>
        <span>Codex</span>
        <span>Cursor</span>
        <span>Veasel</span>
      </div>
      <span class="upstream-flow__detail">
        Trust status travels with it; support is capability-specific.
      </span>
    </article>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="upstream-flow-caption">
    Upstream content enters as a pinned, reviewable proposal. Review changes its
    trust status; distribution and target compatibility remain explicit and
    separate.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
